        "content": "## Unanswered email nudger\nWeekdays 08:00: lists emails you sent 3-21 days ago where nobody replied in the thread. It emails the list to YOU. It never writes to anyone else.\n\n1. Add a Gmail OAuth2 credential to the 3 Gmail nodes.\n2. Set your address in **Email me the list**.\n3. Change 3d/21d in **Sent mail** if you like. Activate.\n\nOutlook / any IMAP: use the Python version.",
